== Rule for disposition ==
Do not infer that similar titles are duplicates.
<pre>
recover body + revision history
→ compare with related versions
→ preserve unique passages / citations / semantics
→ identify historical implementation assumptions
→ determine canonical role
→ only then KEEP / RENAME / MERGE / SPLIT / REDIRECT / ARCHIVE
</pre>

